# Security headers for all responses (Cloudflare Pages merges this with the
# asset cache rule generated by nitro). A Content-Security-Policy is intentionally
# NOT set here — it needs testing against the Google Maps iframe + inline styles;
# see QA_TEST_REPORT.md. HSTS should be enabled at the Cloudflare zone level.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
